# the reader is "sufficient" and a deny catches everything else. Every
# module here is on the passive whitelist, so nothing else refuses it - but
# "sufficient" means success=done, and the attempt lines use success=N, a
# jump that carries on. Rewritten, a matched finger would land on
# pam_deny.so. Must be refused. See JOURNAL.md, 2026-09-15.
